{"title":"Shellweave Arms","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Tailoring Lv 18) · Monster drop: Copperhead, Luna Moth, Glimmerfox</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Tailoring at level 18 <span class=\"muted\">(416 XP)</span> from 1× <a href=\"#/item/iridescent-carapace\">Iridescent Carapace</a>, 2× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"copperhead-medium\" title=\"Copperhead - dropped it in 1 of 224 looted corpses (1/224)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/b134e63b0f937131e7db.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Copperhead</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/224<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"luna-moth\" title=\"Luna Moth - dropped it in 1 of 286 looted corpses (1/286)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a3b4c44c77eff00cb465.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Luna Moth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/286<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"glimmerfox\" title=\"Glimmerfox - dropped it in 1 of 389 looted corpses (1/389)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7418be6744e1d02a8b58.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Glimmerfox</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/389<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"shellweave-arms\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/g